      "side": 1,
      "message": "LED_PULSE_TICK\u003d 125 msec; As our minimum flash time hat we decided is 250 ms, half of 250ms (125 ms) LED will be ON and another half LED will be OFF. LED_PULSE_TICK is half of the minimum pulse period.\n\nLED_FAST_PULSE_PERIOD\u003d2 ; means pulse period is 2 LED_PULSE_TICK (125 ms each), in first tick LED will be ON and in second tick LED will be OFF. This cycle continues until rvp_led[].led_is_pulsing\u003d0.\n\nLED_SLOW_PULSE_PERIOD\u003d16; means pulse period is 16 LED_PULSE_TICK (125 ms each)\u003d 125*16 \u003d 2000 ms \u003d 2 sec; in first 8 ticks LED will be ON and in last 8 ticks LED will be OFF. This cycle continues until rvp_led[].led_is_pulsing\u003d0.",
